window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/b158-42674920670922be.json"]={sha256:"42674920670922bec856b4ec434a97b54dd623770fc98e5f088cc44227c1da43",value:{"id":"b158","title":"隧道二次襯砌台車施工","titleEn":"Tunnel secondary lining with formwork carriages","category":"underground","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"本課以協調台車定位、新拌混凝土壓力與襯砌成形證據為主線，從淨空與襯砌厚度與新拌混凝土側壓建立系統邊界，再把不對稱壓力與上浮、早齡拆模與支承轉換連到台車循環與品質追溯。台車是施工階段構造，完成面淨空與結構厚度必須同時檢核。 十單元以可核算的模型和可追溯證據逐步判讀不同失效。","summaryEn":"This course focuses on coordinate carriage position, fresh-concrete pressure and lining geometry evidence. It begins with Clearance and lining thickness and Fresh-concrete lateral pressure, links Asymmetric pressure and uplift and Early stripping and support transfer, and ends with Carriage cycles and quality traceability. The carriage is a temporary structure; final clearance and structural thickness need simultaneous checks. Ten units use reproducible models and traceable evidence to distinguish failure mechanisms.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、開挖、注漿或受限空間作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, excavation, grouting or confined-space permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"ug-support","subcategoryTitle":"岩體支護與襯砌","subcategoryTitleEn":"Rock support and tunnel linings","learningTrack":"underground","learningSubdiscipline":"ug-support","learningTags":["underground","ug-support","support"],"architectureFamily":"support","architectureNodes":[["淨空與襯砌厚度","Clearance and lining thickness"],["面板跨距與撓度","Panel span and deflection"],["不對稱壓力與上浮","Asymmetric pressure and uplift"],["早齡拆模與支承轉換","Early stripping and support transfer"],["台車循環與品質追溯","Carriage cycles and quality traceability"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[0,3]],"diagram":{"type":"support","labels":["淨空與襯砌厚度","面板跨距與撓度","不對稱壓力與上浮","早齡拆模與支承轉換","台車循環與品質追溯"],"labelsEn":["Clearance and lining thickness","Panel span and deflection","Asymmetric pressure and uplift","Early stripping and support transfer","Carriage cycles and quality traceability"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"整合算例所有輸入均為教學假設。首先檢查淨空與襯砌厚度：thickness=outerRadius-innerRadius=5.30 m-5.00 m=0.30 m；再獨立檢查新拌混凝土側壓：p=gamma*h=24 kN/m3*3 m=72 kPa。外半徑 5.30 m 固定，台車內半徑由 5.00 增為 5.05 m，襯砌厚度由 0.30 降為 0.25 m，減少 16.7%；淨空增加會消耗結構厚度。 兩個結果不能自動組成完整設計，因為台車是施工階段構造，完成面淨空與結構厚度必須同時檢核。 將同步量測核心與表面溫度、應變及裂縫出現時刻作為模型以外的驗證證據，並保留原始紀錄與尚待確認的邊界。","textEn":"All inputs in this integrated example are teaching assumptions. First check Clearance and lining thickness: thickness=outerRadius-innerRadius=5.30 m-5.00 m=0.30 m. Independently check Fresh-concrete lateral pressure: p=gamma*h=24 kN/m3*3 m=72 kPa. At a fixed outer radius of 5.30 m, increasing form radius from 5.00 to 5.05 m reduces thickness from 0.30 to 0.25 m, by 16.7%; increased clearance consumes structural thickness. The two results are not a complete design because the carriage is a temporary structure; final clearance and structural thickness need simultaneous checks. Use synchronize core and surface temperatures, strain and crack-onset times as evidence independent of the calculation, retaining raw records and unverified boundaries.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":14,"enrichmentVersion":14,"stages":[{"id":"b158-v14-s1","title":"地層條件、邊界與工程系統","titleEn":"Ground conditions, boundaries and engineering system","description":"本階段聚焦「淨空與襯砌厚度」與「新拌混凝土側壓」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Clearance and lining thickness\" and \"Fresh-concrete lateral pressure\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b158-v14-01","title":"淨空與襯砌厚度：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Clearance and lining thickness: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「淨空與襯砌厚度」如何影響隧道二次襯砌台車施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Clearance and lining thickness” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Tunnel secondary lining with formwork carriages”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"台車定位同時決定內表面淨空與可用混凝土厚度，向外調整並非只有好處。初支輪廓不規則時，平均半徑合格仍可能局部不足；定位需把軌道基準、台車形狀與初支點雲配準，辨認真正最薄區而非只測拱頂高度。 判別這個機制時，應觀察把初支與模板點雲對齊到同一控制網並搜尋最小間距；若出現台車偏心增加一側淨空卻壓縮另一側結構厚度，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「淨空與襯砌厚度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Carriage positioning sets both clearance and available concrete thickness, so moving outward is not purely beneficial. An irregular initial lining can leave thin zones despite a correct mean radius. Register track control, form geometry and initial-lining clouds to identify local minima rather than crown height alone. Use the following check to discriminate the mechanism: Register support and form clouds to one network and locate minimum separation. If carriage eccentricity increases clearance on one side while consuming thickness on the other, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Clearance and lining thickness” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：thickness=outerRadius-innerRadius=5.30 m-5.00 m=0.30 m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: thickness=outerRadius-innerRadius=5.30 m-5.00 m=0.30 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「內部淨空越大就表示襯砌品質越好」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Greater interior clearance always means better lining quality\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「淨空與襯砌厚度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Clearance and lining thickness”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-01-k1","title":"淨空與襯砌厚度","titleEn":"Clearance and lining thickness","text":"台車定位同時決定內表面淨空與可用混凝土厚度，向外調整並非只有好處。初支輪廓不規則時，平均半徑合格仍可能局部不足；定位需把軌道基準、台車形狀與初支點雲配準，辨認真正最薄區而非只測拱頂高度。","textEn":"Carriage positioning sets both clearance and available concrete thickness, so moving outward is not purely beneficial. An irregular initial lining can leave thin zones despite a correct mean radius.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：內部淨空越大就表示襯砌品質越好 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Greater interior clearance always means better lining quality Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「淨空與襯砌厚度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Clearance and lining thickness\" is correct?","options":["內部淨空越大就表示襯砌品質越好","台車定位同時決定內表面淨空與可用混凝土厚度，向外調整並非只有好處。","混凝土強度高就代表施工側壓一定比較小"],"optionsEn":["Greater interior clearance always means better lining quality","Carriage positioning sets both clearance and available concrete thickness, so moving outward is not purely beneficial.","High concrete strength guarantees lower pressure during placement"],"answer":1,"explanation":"台車定位同時決定內表面淨空與可用混凝土厚度，向外調整並非只有好處。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Carriage positioning sets both clearance and available concrete thickness, so moving outward is not purely beneficial. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b158-v14-02","title":"淨空與襯砌厚度：定量估算","titleEn":"Clearance and lining thickness: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「淨空與襯砌厚度」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Clearance and lining thickness” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：thickness=outerRadius-innerRadius=5.30 m-5.00 m=0.30 m。台車是施工階段構造，完成面淨空與結構厚度必須同時檢核。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: thickness=outerRadius-innerRadius=5.30 m-5.00 m=0.30 m. The carriage is a temporary structure; final clearance and structural thickness need simultaneous checks. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：把初支與模板點雲對齊到同一控制網並搜尋最小間距。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Register support and form clouds to one network and locate minimum separation.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：thickness=outerRadius-innerRadius=5.30 m-5.00 m=0.30 m。台車是施工階段構造，完成面淨空與結構厚度必須同時檢核。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: thickness=outerRadius-innerRadius=5.30 m-5.00 m=0.30 m. The carriage is a temporary structure; final clearance and structural thickness need simultaneous checks. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「淨空與襯砌厚度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Clearance and lining thickness\", which statement holds?","options":["總重量除以支腳數就能得到每腳實際反力","混凝土總用量達到理論值就證明沒有空洞","原創教學假設：thickness=outerRadius-innerRadius=5.30 m-5.00 m=0.30 m。"],"optionsEn":["Total weight divided by foot count gives each actual reaction","Delivered concrete equal to theoretical volume proves there are no voids","Original teaching assumptions: thickness=outerRadius-innerRadius=5.30 m-5.00 m=0.30 m."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設：thickness=outerRadius-innerRadius=5.30 m-5.00 m=0.30 m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: thickness=outerRadius-innerRadius=5.30 m-5.00 m=0.30 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b158-v14-03","title":"淨空與襯砌厚度：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Clearance and lining thickness: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「淨空與襯砌厚度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Clearance and lining thickness” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"把初支與模板點雲對齊到同一控制網並搜尋最小間距。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「台車偏心增加一側淨空卻壓縮另一側結構厚度」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Register support and form clouds to one network and locate minimum separation. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Carriage eccentricity increases clearance on one side while consuming thickness on the other. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將把初支與模板點雲對齊到同一控制網並搜尋最小間距列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現台車偏心增加一側淨空卻壓縮另一側結構厚度，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","observationEn":"Site practice: Apply the following check at handover: Register support and form clouds to one network and locate minimum separation. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If carriage eccentricity increases clearance on one side while consuming thickness on the other, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","failure":"注意干擾：台車偏心增加一側淨空卻壓縮另一側結構厚度。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Carriage eccentricity increases clearance on one side while consuming thickness on the other. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"把初支與模板點雲對齊到同一控制網並搜尋最小間距。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「台車偏心增加一側淨空卻壓縮另一側結構厚度」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。","textEn":"Register support and form clouds to one network and locate minimum separation. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Carriage eccentricity increases clearance on one side while consuming thickness on the other. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將把初支與模板點雲對齊到同一控制網並搜尋最小間距列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現台車偏心增加一側淨空卻壓縮另一側結構厚度，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","textEn":"Apply the following check at handover: Register support and form clouds to one network and locate minimum separation. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If carriage eccentricity increases clearance on one side while consuming thickness on the other, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「淨空與襯砌厚度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Clearance and lining thickness\"?","options":["把初支與模板點雲對齊到同一控制網並搜尋最小間距。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、開挖序列與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","混凝土不再升溫後就不會發生溫度裂縫"],"optionsEn":["Register support and form clouds to one network and locate minimum separation.","Temperature, water head, excavation sequence and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Thermal cracking cannot occur once concrete stops heating"],"answer":0,"explanation":"把初支與模板點雲對齊到同一控制網並搜尋最小間距。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Register support and form clouds to one network and locate minimum separation. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b158-v14-04","title":"淨空與襯砌厚度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Clearance and lining thickness: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「淨空與襯砌厚度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Clearance and lining thickness” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"台車偏心增加一側淨空卻壓縮另一側結構厚度。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到把初支與模板點雲對齊到同一控制網並搜尋最小間距，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Carriage eccentricity increases clearance on one side while consuming thickness on the other. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to register support and form clouds to one network and locate minimum separation to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：判別這個機制時，應觀察把初支與模板點雲對齊到同一控制網並搜尋最小間距；若出現台車偏心增加一側淨空卻壓縮另一側結構厚度，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: If carriage eccentricity increases clearance on one side while consuming thickness on the other, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「內部淨空越大就表示襯砌品質越好」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Greater interior clearance always means better lining quality\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"台車偏心增加一側淨空卻壓縮另一側結構厚度。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到把初支與模板點雲對齊到同一控制網並搜尋最小間距，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。","textEn":"Carriage eccentricity increases clearance on one side while consuming thickness on the other. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to register support and form clouds to one network and locate minimum separation to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「淨空與襯砌厚度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Clearance and lining thickness\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","台車偏心增加一側淨空卻壓縮另一側結構厚度。","混凝土強度高就代表施工側壓一定比較小"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Carriage eccentricity increases clearance on one side while consuming thickness on the other.","High concrete strength guarantees lower pressure during placement"],"answer":1,"explanation":"台車偏心增加一側淨空卻壓縮另一側結構厚度。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Carriage eccentricity increases clearance on one side while consuming thickness on the other. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b158-v14-05","title":"新拌混凝土側壓：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Fresh-concrete lateral pressure: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-04"],"objective":"說明「新拌混凝土側壓」如何影響隧道二次襯砌台車施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Fresh-concrete lateral pressure” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Tunnel secondary lining with formwork carriages”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"新拌混凝土在凝結前會對模板產生側壓，壓力分布取決於流變、齡期和施工歷程。液體靜壓只是參考上界情境，不能把長期硬化混凝土當作同樣材料；模板、支架和地基應沿完整路徑傳遞這段短期作用。 判別這個機制時，應觀察量測模板壓力並對照混凝土溫度、齡期及填充高度；若出現誤用已凝結假設低估側壓，模板鼓脹造成輪廓失真，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「新拌混凝土側壓」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Fresh concrete loads forms before setting, with pressure governed by rheology, age and placement history. Hydrostatic pressure is a reference scenario rather than hardened-concrete behaviour. Forms, frames and foundations must transfer this temporary action through a complete load path. Use the following check to discriminate the mechanism: Compare form pressures with concrete temperature, age and fill height. If an assumed set state understates pressure and allows forms to bulge out of profile, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Fresh-concrete lateral pressure” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：p=gamma*h=24 kN/m3*3 m=72 kPa。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: p=gamma*h=24 kN/m3*3 m=72 kPa.","failure":"常見誤解：「混凝土強度高就代表施工側壓一定比較小」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"High concrete strength guarantees lower pressure during placement\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「新拌混凝土側壓」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Fresh-concrete lateral pressure”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-05-k1","title":"新拌混凝土側壓","titleEn":"Fresh-concrete lateral pressure","text":"新拌混凝土在凝結前會對模板產生側壓，壓力分布取決於流變、齡期和施工歷程。液體靜壓只是參考上界情境，不能把長期硬化混凝土當作同樣材料；模板、支架和地基應沿完整路徑傳遞這段短期作用。","textEn":"Fresh concrete loads forms before setting, with pressure governed by rheology, age and placement history. Hydrostatic pressure is a reference scenario rather than hardened-concrete behaviour.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：混凝土強度高就代表施工側壓一定比較小 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: High concrete strength guarantees lower pressure during placement Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「新拌混凝土側壓」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Fresh-concrete lateral pressure\" is correct?","options":["混凝土強度高就代表施工側壓一定比較小","模板厚度一致就能保證每一位置撓度一致","新拌混凝土在凝結前會對模板產生側壓，壓力分布取決於流變、齡期和施工歷程。"],"optionsEn":["High concrete strength guarantees lower pressure during placement","Uniform form thickness guarantees uniform deflection at every position","Fresh concrete loads forms before setting, with pressure governed by rheology, age and placement history."],"answer":2,"explanation":"新拌混凝土在凝結前會對模板產生側壓，壓力分布取決於流變、齡期和施工歷程。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Fresh concrete loads forms before setting, with pressure governed by rheology, age and placement history. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b158-v14-06","title":"新拌混凝土側壓：定量估算","titleEn":"Fresh-concrete lateral pressure: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「新拌混凝土側壓」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Fresh-concrete lateral pressure” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：p=gamma*h=24 kN/m3*3 m=72 kPa。台車是施工階段構造，完成面淨空與結構厚度必須同時檢核。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: p=gamma*h=24 kN/m3*3 m=72 kPa. The carriage is a temporary structure; final clearance and structural thickness need simultaneous checks. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：量測模板壓力並對照混凝土溫度、齡期及填充高度。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare form pressures with concrete temperature, age and fill height.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：p=gamma*h=24 kN/m3*3 m=72 kPa。台車是施工階段構造，完成面淨空與結構厚度必須同時檢核。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: p=gamma*h=24 kN/m3*3 m=72 kPa. The carriage is a temporary structure; final clearance and structural thickness need simultaneous checks. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「新拌混凝土側壓」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Fresh-concrete lateral pressure\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設：p=gamma*h=24 kN/m3*3 m=72 kPa。","台車很重就不可能受到混凝土壓力抬升","早齡抗壓比值低就能取代所有拆模階段檢核"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching assumptions: p=gamma*h=24 kN/m3*3 m=72 kPa.","A heavy carriage cannot be lifted by concrete pressure","A low early compression ratio replaces every stripping-stage check"],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設：p=gamma*h=24 kN/m3*3 m=72 kPa。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: p=gamma*h=24 kN/m3*3 m=72 kPa. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b158-v14-07","title":"新拌混凝土側壓：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Fresh-concrete lateral pressure: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「新拌混凝土側壓」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Fresh-concrete lateral pressure” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"量測模板壓力並對照混凝土溫度、齡期及填充高度。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「誤用已凝結假設低估側壓，模板鼓脹造成輪廓失真」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare form pressures with concrete temperature, age and fill height. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: An assumed set state understates pressure and allows forms to bulge out of profile. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將量測模板壓力並對照混凝土溫度、齡期及填充高度列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現誤用已凝結假設低估側壓，模板鼓脹造成輪廓失真，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","observationEn":"Site practice: Apply the following check at handover: Compare form pressures with concrete temperature, age and fill height. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If an assumed set state understates pressure and allows forms to bulge out of profile, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","failure":"注意干擾：誤用已凝結假設低估側壓，模板鼓脹造成輪廓失真。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: An assumed set state understates pressure and allows forms to bulge out of profile. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"量測模板壓力並對照混凝土溫度、齡期及填充高度。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「誤用已凝結假設低估側壓，模板鼓脹造成輪廓失真」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。","textEn":"Compare form pressures with concrete temperature, age and fill height. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: An assumed set state understates pressure and allows forms to bulge out of profile. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將量測模板壓力並對照混凝土溫度、齡期及填充高度列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現誤用已凝結假設低估側壓，模板鼓脹造成輪廓失真，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","textEn":"Apply the following check at handover: Compare form pressures with concrete temperature, age and fill height. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If an assumed set state understates pressure and allows forms to bulge out of profile, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「新拌混凝土側壓」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Fresh-concrete lateral pressure\"?","options":["沿用另一條隧道或另一處地層的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","量測模板壓力並對照混凝土溫度、齡期及填充高度。","接縫外表平整就能保證內部止水帶位置正確"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another tunnel or ground formation counts as verifying this structure.","Compare form pressures with concrete temperature, age and fill height.","A flush surface joint guarantees the internal waterstop is correctly located"],"answer":1,"explanation":"量測模板壓力並對照混凝土溫度、齡期及填充高度。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare form pressures with concrete temperature, age and fill height. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b158-v14-08","title":"新拌混凝土側壓：失效診斷","titleEn":"Fresh-concrete lateral pressure: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「新拌混凝土側壓」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Fresh-concrete lateral pressure” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"誤用已凝結假設低估側壓，模板鼓脹造成輪廓失真。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到量測模板壓力並對照混凝土溫度、齡期及填充高度，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"An assumed set state understates pressure and allows forms to bulge out of profile. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare form pressures with concrete temperature, age and fill height to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：判別這個機制時，應觀察量測模板壓力並對照混凝土溫度、齡期及填充高度；若出現誤用已凝結假設低估側壓，模板鼓脹造成輪廓失真，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: If an assumed set state understates pressure and allows forms to bulge out of profile, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「混凝土強度高就代表施工側壓一定比較小」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"High concrete strength guarantees lower pressure during placement\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"誤用已凝結假設低估側壓，模板鼓脹造成輪廓失真。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到量測模板壓力並對照混凝土溫度、齡期及填充高度，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。","textEn":"An assumed set state understates pressure and allows forms to bulge out of profile. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare form pressures with concrete temperature, age and fill height to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「新拌混凝土側壓」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Fresh-concrete lateral pressure\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","模板厚度一致就能保證每一位置撓度一致","誤用已凝結假設低估側壓，模板鼓脹造成輪廓失真。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Uniform form thickness guarantees uniform deflection at every position","An assumed set state understates pressure and allows forms to bulge out of profile."],"answer":2,"explanation":"誤用已凝結假設低估側壓，模板鼓脹造成輪廓失真。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"An assumed set state understates pressure and allows forms to bulge out of profile. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b158-v14-s2","title":"機制、材料與定量設計","titleEn":"Mechanisms, materials and quantitative design","description":"本階段聚焦「面板跨距與撓度」與「支架反力與地基承壓」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Panel span and deflection\" and \"Frame reactions and foundation bearing\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b158-v14-09","title":"面板跨距與撓度：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Panel span and deflection: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-08"],"objective":"說明「面板跨距與撓度」如何影響隧道二次襯砌台車施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Panel span and deflection” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Tunnel secondary lining with formwork carriages”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"面板在肋材間彎曲，支承間距對變形極敏感；相同均布線荷載作用於較大未支承跨距，會增加局部鼓出。簡支條帶的跨度四次方關係須保持線荷載 q、EI 與支承條件不變；固定總力不是同一假設。實際板還有雙向剛度與接頭，不能只靠平均模板厚度判斷。 判別這個機制時，應觀察比較肋距、面板中心位移與接縫兩側的高差；若出現局部缺肋讓面板撓度增加，形成難以修正的襯砌凹凸，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「面板跨距與撓度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Panels bend between ribs and are highly sensitive to support spacing. The same uniform line load over a longer unsupported span increases bulging. Fourth-power span scaling requires unchanged line load q, EI and support conditions; fixed total force is a different assumption. Actual panels add two-way action and joints beyond mean plate thickness. Use the following check to discriminate the mechanism: Compare rib spacing, panel-centre displacement and steps across seams. If a missing rib increases local deflection and creates permanent lining irregularity, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Panel span and deflection” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：deflectionRatio=(newSpan/oldSpan)^4=(1.1/1.0)^4=1.4641 for unchanged uniform line load q, EI and simple-support conditions。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: deflectionRatio=(newSpan/oldSpan)^4=(1.1/1.0)^4=1.4641 for unchanged uniform line load q, EI and simple-support conditions.","failure":"常見誤解：「模板厚度一致就能保證每一位置撓度一致」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Uniform form thickness guarantees uniform deflection at every position\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「面板跨距與撓度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Panel span and deflection”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-09-k1","title":"面板跨距與撓度","titleEn":"Panel span and deflection","text":"面板在肋材間彎曲，支承間距對變形極敏感；相同均布線荷載作用於較大未支承跨距，會增加局部鼓出。簡支條帶的跨度四次方關係須保持線荷載 q、EI 與支承條件不變；固定總力不是同一假設。","textEn":"Panels bend between ribs and are highly sensitive to support spacing. The same uniform line load over a longer unsupported span increases bulging.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：模板厚度一致就能保證每一位置撓度一致 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Uniform form thickness guarantees uniform deflection at every position Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「面板跨距與撓度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Panel span and deflection\" is correct?","options":["面板在肋材間彎曲，支承間距對變形極敏感；相同均布線荷載作用於較大未支承跨距，會增加局部鼓出。","模板厚度一致就能保證每一位置撓度一致","總重量除以支腳數就能得到每腳實際反力"],"optionsEn":["Panels bend between ribs and are highly sensitive to support spacing.","Uniform form thickness guarantees uniform deflection at every position","Total weight divided by foot count gives each actual reaction"],"answer":0,"explanation":"面板在肋材間彎曲，支承間距對變形極敏感；相同均布線荷載作用於較大未支承跨距，會增加局部鼓出。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Panels bend between ribs and are highly sensitive to support spacing. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b158-v14-10","title":"面板跨距與撓度：定量估算","titleEn":"Panel span and deflection: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「面板跨距與撓度」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Panel span and deflection” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：deflectionRatio=(newSpan/oldSpan)^4=(1.1/1.0)^4=1.4641 for unchanged uniform line load q, EI and simple-support conditions。台車是施工階段構造，完成面淨空與結構厚度必須同時檢核。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: deflectionRatio=(newSpan/oldSpan)^4=(1.1/1.0)^4=1.4641 for unchanged uniform line load q, EI and simple-support conditions. The carriage is a temporary structure; final clearance and structural thickness need simultaneous checks. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：比較肋距、面板中心位移與接縫兩側的高差。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare rib spacing, panel-centre displacement and steps across seams.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：deflectionRatio=(newSpan/oldSpan)^4=(1.1/1.0)^4=1.4641 for unchanged uniform line load q, EI and simple-support conditions。台車是施工階段構造，完成面淨空與結構厚度必須同時檢核。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: deflectionRatio=(newSpan/oldSpan)^4=(1.1/1.0)^4=1.4641 for unchanged uniform line load q, EI and simple-support conditions. The carriage is a temporary structure; final clearance and structural thickness need simultaneous checks. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「面板跨距與撓度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Panel span and deflection\", which statement holds?","options":["混凝土總用量達到理論值就證明沒有空洞","原創教學假設：deflectionRatio=(newSpan/oldSpan)^4=(1.1/1.0)^4=1.4641 for unchanged uniform line load q, EI and simple-support conditions。","混凝土不再升溫後就不會發生溫度裂縫"],"optionsEn":["Delivered concrete equal to theoretical volume proves there are no voids","Original teaching assumptions: deflectionRatio=(newSpan/oldSpan)^4=(1.1/1.0)^4=1.4641 for unchanged uniform line load q, EI and simple-support conditions.","Thermal cracking cannot occur once concrete stops heating"],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設：deflectionRatio=(newSpan/oldSpan)^4=(1.1/1.0)^4=1.4641 for unchanged uniform line load q, EI and simple-support conditions。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: deflectionRatio=(newSpan/oldSpan)^4=(1.1/1.0)^4=1.4641 for unchanged uniform line load q, EI and simple-support conditions. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b158-v14-11","title":"面板跨距與撓度：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Panel span and deflection: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「面板跨距與撓度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Panel span and deflection” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"比較肋距、面板中心位移與接縫兩側的高差。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「局部缺肋讓面板撓度增加，形成難以修正的襯砌凹凸」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare rib spacing, panel-centre displacement and steps across seams. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: A missing rib increases local deflection and creates permanent lining irregularity. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將比較肋距、面板中心位移與接縫兩側的高差列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現局部缺肋讓面板撓度增加，形成難以修正的襯砌凹凸，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","observationEn":"Site practice: Apply the following check at handover: Compare rib spacing, panel-centre displacement and steps across seams. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If a missing rib increases local deflection and creates permanent lining irregularity, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","failure":"注意干擾：局部缺肋讓面板撓度增加，形成難以修正的襯砌凹凸。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A missing rib increases local deflection and creates permanent lining irregularity. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"比較肋距、面板中心位移與接縫兩側的高差。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「局部缺肋讓面板撓度增加，形成難以修正的襯砌凹凸」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。","textEn":"Compare rib spacing, panel-centre displacement and steps across seams. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: A missing rib increases local deflection and creates permanent lining irregularity. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將比較肋距、面板中心位移與接縫兩側的高差列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現局部缺肋讓面板撓度增加，形成難以修正的襯砌凹凸，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","textEn":"Apply the following check at handover: Compare rib spacing, panel-centre displacement and steps across seams. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If a missing rib increases local deflection and creates permanent lining irregularity, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「面板跨距與撓度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Panel span and deflection\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","台車出廠合格就不需要每循環重新定位檢查","比較肋距、面板中心位移與接縫兩側的高差。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Factory-approved carriages never need positioning checks during later cycles","Compare rib spacing, panel-centre displacement and steps across seams."],"answer":2,"explanation":"比較肋距、面板中心位移與接縫兩側的高差。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare rib spacing, panel-centre displacement and steps across seams. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b158-v14-12","title":"面板跨距與撓度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Panel span and deflection: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「面板跨距與撓度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Panel span and deflection” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"局部缺肋讓面板撓度增加，形成難以修正的襯砌凹凸。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到比較肋距、面板中心位移與接縫兩側的高差，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A missing rib increases local deflection and creates permanent lining irregularity. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare rib spacing, panel-centre displacement and steps across seams to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：判別這個機制時，應觀察比較肋距、面板中心位移與接縫兩側的高差；若出現局部缺肋讓面板撓度增加，形成難以修正的襯砌凹凸，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: If a missing rib increases local deflection and creates permanent lining irregularity, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「模板厚度一致就能保證每一位置撓度一致」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Uniform form thickness guarantees uniform deflection at every position\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"局部缺肋讓面板撓度增加，形成難以修正的襯砌凹凸。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到比較肋距、面板中心位移與接縫兩側的高差，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。","textEn":"A missing rib increases local deflection and creates permanent lining irregularity. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare rib spacing, panel-centre displacement and steps across seams to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「面板跨距與撓度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Panel span and deflection\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["局部缺肋讓面板撓度增加，形成難以修正的襯砌凹凸。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","總重量除以支腳數就能得到每腳實際反力"],"optionsEn":["A missing rib increases local deflection and creates permanent lining irregularity.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Total weight divided by foot count gives each actual reaction"],"answer":0,"explanation":"局部缺肋讓面板撓度增加，形成難以修正的襯砌凹凸。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A missing rib increases local deflection and creates permanent lining irregularity. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b158-v14-13","title":"支架反力與地基承壓：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Frame reactions and foundation bearing: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-12"],"objective":"說明「支架反力與地基承壓」如何影響隧道二次襯砌台車施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Frame reactions and foundation bearing” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Tunnel secondary lining with formwork carriages”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"模板荷載經支架傳到支腳或軌道，偏心填充可能讓某些支腳先受力或局部抬起。總重量平均分配只適用理想對稱，基底柔度會重新分配反力；檢查應同時包含支架力、接觸狀態及基準沉陷。 判別這個機制時，應觀察將支腳荷重、底板接觸與軌道水準同步比較；若出現一支腳沉陷讓相鄰支架超載，台車整體產生扭曲，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「支架反力與地基承壓」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Form loads reach feet or rails through the frame, while asymmetric filling can load some feet first or lift others. Equal distribution assumes symmetry; foundation compliance redistributes reactions. Verify frame forces, contact status and datum settlement together rather than total weight alone. Use the following check to discriminate the mechanism: Compare foot loads, bearing contact and rail levels on a common time base. If one settling foot overloads neighbouring supports and twists the carriage, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Frame reactions and foundation bearing” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：bearingPressure=footReaction/area=360 kN/0.60 m2=600 kPa。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: bearingPressure=footReaction/area=360 kN/0.60 m2=600 kPa.","failure":"常見誤解：「總重量除以支腳數就能得到每腳實際反力」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Total weight divided by foot count gives each actual reaction\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「支架反力與地基承壓」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Frame reactions and foundation bearing”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-13-k1","title":"支架反力與地基承壓","titleEn":"Frame reactions and foundation bearing","text":"模板荷載經支架傳到支腳或軌道，偏心填充可能讓某些支腳先受力或局部抬起。總重量平均分配只適用理想對稱，基底柔度會重新分配反力；檢查應同時包含支架力、接觸狀態及基準沉陷。","textEn":"Form loads reach feet or rails through the frame, while asymmetric filling can load some feet first or lift others. Equal distribution assumes symmetry; foundation compliance redistributes reactions.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：總重量除以支腳數就能得到每腳實際反力 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Total weight divided by foot count gives each actual reaction Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「支架反力與地基承壓」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Frame reactions and foundation bearing\" is correct?","options":["總重量除以支腳數就能得到每腳實際反力","模板荷載經支架傳到支腳或軌道，偏心填充可能讓某些支腳先受力或局部抬起。","台車很重就不可能受到混凝土壓力抬升"],"optionsEn":["Total weight divided by foot count gives each actual reaction","Form loads reach feet or rails through the frame, while asymmetric filling can load some feet first or lift others.","A heavy carriage cannot be lifted by concrete pressure"],"answer":1,"explanation":"模板荷載經支架傳到支腳或軌道，偏心填充可能讓某些支腳先受力或局部抬起。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Form loads reach feet or rails through the frame, while asymmetric filling can load some feet first or lift others. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b158-v14-14","title":"支架反力與地基承壓：定量估算","titleEn":"Frame reactions and foundation bearing: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「支架反力與地基承壓」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Frame reactions and foundation bearing” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：bearingPressure=footReaction/area=360 kN/0.60 m2=600 kPa。台車是施工階段構造，完成面淨空與結構厚度必須同時檢核。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: bearingPressure=footReaction/area=360 kN/0.60 m2=600 kPa. The carriage is a temporary structure; final clearance and structural thickness need simultaneous checks. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：將支腳荷重、底板接觸與軌道水準同步比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare foot loads, bearing contact and rail levels on a common time base.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：bearingPressure=footReaction/area=360 kN/0.60 m2=600 kPa。台車是施工階段構造，完成面淨空與結構厚度必須同時檢核。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: bearingPressure=footReaction/area=360 kN/0.60 m2=600 kPa. The carriage is a temporary structure; final clearance and structural thickness need simultaneous checks. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「支架反力與地基承壓」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Frame reactions and foundation bearing\", which statement holds?","options":["早齡抗壓比值低就能取代所有拆模階段檢核","接縫外表平整就能保證內部止水帶位置正確","原創教學假設：bearingPressure=footReaction/area=360 kN/0.60 m2=600 kPa。"],"optionsEn":["A low early compression ratio replaces every stripping-stage check","A flush surface joint guarantees the internal waterstop is correctly located","Original teaching assumptions: bearingPressure=footReaction/area=360 kN/0.60 m2=600 kPa."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設：bearingPressure=footReaction/area=360 kN/0.60 m2=600 kPa。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: bearingPressure=footReaction/area=360 kN/0.60 m2=600 kPa. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b158-v14-15","title":"支架反力與地基承壓：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Frame reactions and foundation bearing: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「支架反力與地基承壓」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Frame reactions and foundation bearing” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"將支腳荷重、底板接觸與軌道水準同步比較。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「一支腳沉陷讓相鄰支架超載，台車整體產生扭曲」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare foot loads, bearing contact and rail levels on a common time base. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: One settling foot overloads neighbouring supports and twists the carriage. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將將支腳荷重、底板接觸與軌道水準同步比較列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現一支腳沉陷讓相鄰支架超載，台車整體產生扭曲，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","observationEn":"Site practice: Apply the following check at handover: Compare foot loads, bearing contact and rail levels on a common time base. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If one settling foot overloads neighbouring supports and twists the carriage, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","failure":"注意干擾：一支腳沉陷讓相鄰支架超載，台車整體產生扭曲。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: One settling foot overloads neighbouring supports and twists the carriage. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"將支腳荷重、底板接觸與軌道水準同步比較。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「一支腳沉陷讓相鄰支架超載，台車整體產生扭曲」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。","textEn":"Compare foot loads, bearing contact and rail levels on a common time base. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: One settling foot overloads neighbouring supports and twists the carriage. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將將支腳荷重、底板接觸與軌道水準同步比較列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現一支腳沉陷讓相鄰支架超載，台車整體產生扭曲，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","textEn":"Apply the following check at handover: Compare foot loads, bearing contact and rail levels on a common time base. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If one settling foot overloads neighbouring supports and twists the carriage, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「支架反力與地基承壓」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Frame reactions and foundation bearing\"?","options":["將支腳荷重、底板接觸與軌道水準同步比較。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","內部淨空越大就表示襯砌品質越好"],"optionsEn":["Compare foot loads, bearing contact and rail levels on a common time base.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Greater interior clearance always means better lining quality"],"answer":0,"explanation":"將支腳荷重、底板接觸與軌道水準同步比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare foot loads, bearing contact and rail levels on a common time base. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b158-v14-16","title":"支架反力與地基承壓：失效診斷","titleEn":"Frame reactions and foundation bearing: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「支架反力與地基承壓」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Frame reactions and foundation bearing” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"一支腳沉陷讓相鄰支架超載，台車整體產生扭曲。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到將支腳荷重、底板接觸與軌道水準同步比較，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"One settling foot overloads neighbouring supports and twists the carriage. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare foot loads, bearing contact and rail levels on a common time base to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：判別這個機制時，應觀察將支腳荷重、底板接觸與軌道水準同步比較；若出現一支腳沉陷讓相鄰支架超載，台車整體產生扭曲，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: If one settling foot overloads neighbouring supports and twists the carriage, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「總重量除以支腳數就能得到每腳實際反力」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Total weight divided by foot count gives each actual reaction\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"一支腳沉陷讓相鄰支架超載，台車整體產生扭曲。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到將支腳荷重、底板接觸與軌道水準同步比較，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。","textEn":"One settling foot overloads neighbouring supports and twists the carriage. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare foot loads, bearing contact and rail levels on a common time base to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「支架反力與地基承壓」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Frame reactions and foundation bearing\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","一支腳沉陷讓相鄰支架超載，台車整體產生扭曲。","台車很重就不可能受到混凝土壓力抬升"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","One settling foot overloads neighbouring supports and twists the carriage.","A heavy carriage cannot be lifted by concrete pressure"],"answer":1,"explanation":"一支腳沉陷讓相鄰支架超載，台車整體產生扭曲。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"One settling foot overloads neighbouring supports and twists the carriage. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b158-v14-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「不對稱壓力與上浮」與「拱頂填充與空洞」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Asymmetric pressure and uplift\" and \"Crown filling and voids\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b158-v14-17","title":"不對稱壓力與上浮：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Asymmetric pressure and uplift: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-16"],"objective":"說明「不對稱壓力與上浮」如何影響隧道二次襯砌台車施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Asymmetric pressure and uplift” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Tunnel secondary lining with formwork carriages”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"混凝土壓力作用在模板不同方向，垂直分量可能產生上浮，水平不平衡則推動台車。只核對自重不能證明穩定，約束位置與反力容量必須配合實際載入階段；局部脫離支腳後，原先線性分配也會改變。 判別這個機制時，應觀察比較台車垂直位移、支腳接觸和約束荷重歷程；若出現壓力不平衡抬起一側，使模板接縫張開與漏漿，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「不對稱壓力與上浮」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Pressure acts in different directions, generating uplift or lateral imbalance. Self-weight alone does not establish stability; restraint positions and reactions must match the stage. Once a foot separates, the assumed linear distribution changes and requires a revised contact model. Use the following check to discriminate the mechanism: Compare vertical carriage motion, foot contact and restraint-force histories. If unbalanced pressure lifts one side, opening form joints and releasing grout, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Asymmetric pressure and uplift” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：uplift=p*A=80 kPa*8 m2=640 kN for an assumed projected area。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: uplift=p*A=80 kPa*8 m2=640 kN for an assumed projected area.","failure":"常見誤解：「台車很重就不可能受到混凝土壓力抬升」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A heavy carriage cannot be lifted by concrete pressure\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「不對稱壓力與上浮」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Asymmetric pressure and uplift”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-17-k1","title":"不對稱壓力與上浮","titleEn":"Asymmetric pressure and uplift","text":"混凝土壓力作用在模板不同方向，垂直分量可能產生上浮，水平不平衡則推動台車。只核對自重不能證明穩定，約束位置與反力容量必須配合實際載入階段；局部脫離支腳後，原先線性分配也會改變。","textEn":"Pressure acts in different directions, generating uplift or lateral imbalance. Self-weight alone does not establish stability; restraint positions and reactions must match the stage.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：台車很重就不可能受到混凝土壓力抬升 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A heavy carriage cannot be lifted by concrete pressure Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「不對稱壓力與上浮」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Asymmetric pressure and uplift\" is correct?","options":["台車很重就不可能受到混凝土壓力抬升","混凝土總用量達到理論值就證明沒有空洞","混凝土壓力作用在模板不同方向，垂直分量可能產生上浮，水平不平衡則推動台車。"],"optionsEn":["A heavy carriage cannot be lifted by concrete pressure","Delivered concrete equal to theoretical volume proves there are no voids","Pressure acts in different directions, generating uplift or lateral imbalance."],"answer":2,"explanation":"混凝土壓力作用在模板不同方向，垂直分量可能產生上浮，水平不平衡則推動台車。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Pressure acts in different directions, generating uplift or lateral imbalance. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b158-v14-18","title":"不對稱壓力與上浮：定量估算","titleEn":"Asymmetric pressure and uplift: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「不對稱壓力與上浮」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Asymmetric pressure and uplift” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：uplift=p*A=80 kPa*8 m2=640 kN for an assumed projected area。台車是施工階段構造，完成面淨空與結構厚度必須同時檢核。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: uplift=p*A=80 kPa*8 m2=640 kN for an assumed projected area. The carriage is a temporary structure; final clearance and structural thickness need simultaneous checks. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：比較台車垂直位移、支腳接觸和約束荷重歷程。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare vertical carriage motion, foot contact and restraint-force histories.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：uplift=p*A=80 kPa*8 m2=640 kN for an assumed projected area。台車是施工階段構造，完成面淨空與結構厚度必須同時檢核。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: uplift=p*A=80 kPa*8 m2=640 kN for an assumed projected area. The carriage is a temporary structure; final clearance and structural thickness need simultaneous checks. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「不對稱壓力與上浮」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Asymmetric pressure and uplift\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設：uplift=p*A=80 kPa*8 m2=640 kN for an assumed projected area。","混凝土不再升溫後就不會發生溫度裂縫","台車出廠合格就不需要每循環重新定位檢查"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching assumptions: uplift=p*A=80 kPa*8 m2=640 kN for an assumed projected area.","Thermal cracking cannot occur once concrete stops heating","Factory-approved carriages never need positioning checks during later cycles"],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設：uplift=p*A=80 kPa*8 m2=640 kN for an assumed projected area。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: uplift=p*A=80 kPa*8 m2=640 kN for an assumed projected area. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b158-v14-19","title":"不對稱壓力與上浮：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Asymmetric pressure and uplift: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「不對稱壓力與上浮」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Asymmetric pressure and uplift” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"比較台車垂直位移、支腳接觸和約束荷重歷程。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「壓力不平衡抬起一側，使模板接縫張開與漏漿」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare vertical carriage motion, foot contact and restraint-force histories. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Unbalanced pressure lifts one side, opening form joints and releasing grout. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將比較台車垂直位移、支腳接觸和約束荷重歷程列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現壓力不平衡抬起一側，使模板接縫張開與漏漿，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","observationEn":"Site practice: Apply the following check at handover: Compare vertical carriage motion, foot contact and restraint-force histories. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If unbalanced pressure lifts one side, opening form joints and releasing grout, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","failure":"注意干擾：壓力不平衡抬起一側，使模板接縫張開與漏漿。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Unbalanced pressure lifts one side, opening form joints and releasing grout. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"比較台車垂直位移、支腳接觸和約束荷重歷程。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「壓力不平衡抬起一側，使模板接縫張開與漏漿」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。","textEn":"Compare vertical carriage motion, foot contact and restraint-force histories. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Unbalanced pressure lifts one side, opening form joints and releasing grout. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將比較台車垂直位移、支腳接觸和約束荷重歷程列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現壓力不平衡抬起一側，使模板接縫張開與漏漿，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","textEn":"Apply the following check at handover: Compare vertical carriage motion, foot contact and restraint-force histories. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If unbalanced pressure lifts one side, opening form joints and releasing grout, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「不對稱壓力與上浮」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Asymmetric pressure and uplift\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","比較台車垂直位移、支腳接觸和約束荷重歷程。","混凝土強度高就代表施工側壓一定比較小"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Compare vertical carriage motion, foot contact and restraint-force histories.","High concrete strength guarantees lower pressure during placement"],"answer":1,"explanation":"比較台車垂直位移、支腳接觸和約束荷重歷程。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare vertical carriage motion, foot contact and restraint-force histories. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b158-v14-20","title":"不對稱壓力與上浮：失效診斷","titleEn":"Asymmetric pressure and uplift: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「不對稱壓力與上浮」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Asymmetric pressure and uplift” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"壓力不平衡抬起一側，使模板接縫張開與漏漿。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到比較台車垂直位移、支腳接觸和約束荷重歷程，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Unbalanced pressure lifts one side, opening form joints and releasing grout. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare vertical carriage motion, foot contact and restraint-force histories to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：判別這個機制時，應觀察比較台車垂直位移、支腳接觸和約束荷重歷程；若出現壓力不平衡抬起一側，使模板接縫張開與漏漿，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: If unbalanced pressure lifts one side, opening form joints and releasing grout, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「台車很重就不可能受到混凝土壓力抬升」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A heavy carriage cannot be lifted by concrete pressure\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"壓力不平衡抬起一側，使模板接縫張開與漏漿。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到比較台車垂直位移、支腳接觸和約束荷重歷程，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。","textEn":"Unbalanced pressure lifts one side, opening form joints and releasing grout. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare vertical carriage motion, foot contact and restraint-force histories to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「不對稱壓力與上浮」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Asymmetric pressure and uplift\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","混凝土總用量達到理論值就證明沒有空洞","壓力不平衡抬起一側，使模板接縫張開與漏漿。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Delivered concrete equal to theoretical volume proves there are no voids","Unbalanced pressure lifts one side, opening form joints and releasing grout."],"answer":2,"explanation":"壓力不平衡抬起一側，使模板接縫張開與漏漿。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Unbalanced pressure lifts one side, opening form joints and releasing grout. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b158-v14-21","title":"拱頂填充與空洞：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Crown filling and voids: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-20"],"objective":"說明「拱頂填充與空洞」如何影響隧道二次襯砌台車施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Crown filling and voids” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Tunnel secondary lining with formwork carriages”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"拱頂是氣體與未填滿空間容易聚集的位置，出料量足夠不代表所有高點密實。理論體積與送入量的差也包含管路殘留、超挖和漏漿，不能直接等同空洞；應以多種證據區分幾何偏差與真正未填區。 判別這個機制時，應觀察對照材料收支、拱頂檢測與可取得的孔內或雷達證據；若出現拱頂空洞削弱接觸並集中彎曲，外表平順仍可能漏判，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「拱頂填充與空洞」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Air and unfilled space collect at high points; adequate delivery does not prove a dense crown. Theoretical-versus-delivered volume also includes line residue, overbreak and leakage. Combine evidence to distinguish geometric differences from actual voids instead of treating the balance residual as a direct void measurement. Use the following check to discriminate the mechanism: Compare material balance with crown checks and available borehole or radar evidence. If a crown void weakens contact and concentrates bending despite a smooth interior, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Crown filling and voids” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：Inputs outerRadius=5.30 m, innerRadius=5.00 m, length=10 m; fullRingVolume=pi*(5.30^2-5.00^2)*10=97.08 m3, idealized full circular ring。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: Inputs outerRadius=5.30 m, innerRadius=5.00 m, length=10 m; fullRingVolume=pi*(5.30^2-5.00^2)*10=97.08 m3, idealized full circular ring.","failure":"常見誤解：「混凝土總用量達到理論值就證明沒有空洞」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Delivered concrete equal to theoretical volume proves there are no voids\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「拱頂填充與空洞」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Crown filling and voids”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-21-k1","title":"拱頂填充與空洞","titleEn":"Crown filling and voids","text":"拱頂是氣體與未填滿空間容易聚集的位置，出料量足夠不代表所有高點密實。理論體積與送入量的差也包含管路殘留、超挖和漏漿，不能直接等同空洞；應以多種證據區分幾何偏差與真正未填區。","textEn":"Air and unfilled space collect at high points; adequate delivery does not prove a dense crown. Theoretical-versus-delivered volume also includes line residue, overbreak and leakage.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：混凝土總用量達到理論值就證明沒有空洞 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Delivered concrete equal to theoretical volume proves there are no voids Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「拱頂填充與空洞」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Crown filling and voids\" is correct?","options":["拱頂是氣體與未填滿空間容易聚集的位置，出料量足夠不代表所有高點密實。","混凝土總用量達到理論值就證明沒有空洞","早齡抗壓比值低就能取代所有拆模階段檢核"],"optionsEn":["Air and unfilled space collect at high points; adequate delivery does not prove a dense crown.","Delivered concrete equal to theoretical volume proves there are no voids","A low early compression ratio replaces every stripping-stage check"],"answer":0,"explanation":"拱頂是氣體與未填滿空間容易聚集的位置，出料量足夠不代表所有高點密實。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Air and unfilled space collect at high points; adequate delivery does not prove a dense crown. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b158-v14-22","title":"拱頂填充與空洞：定量估算","titleEn":"Crown filling and voids: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「拱頂填充與空洞」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Crown filling and voids” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：Inputs outerRadius=5.30 m, innerRadius=5.00 m, length=10 m; fullRingVolume=pi*(5.30^2-5.00^2)*10=97.08 m3, idealized full circular ring。台車是施工階段構造，完成面淨空與結構厚度必須同時檢核。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: Inputs outerRadius=5.30 m, innerRadius=5.00 m, length=10 m; fullRingVolume=pi*(5.30^2-5.00^2)*10=97.08 m3, idealized full circular ring. The carriage is a temporary structure; final clearance and structural thickness need simultaneous checks. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：對照材料收支、拱頂檢測與可取得的孔內或雷達證據。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare material balance with crown checks and available borehole or radar evidence.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：Inputs outerRadius=5.30 m, innerRadius=5.00 m, length=10 m; fullRingVolume=pi*(5.30^2-5.00^2)*10=97.08 m3, idealized full circular ring。台車是施工階段構造，完成面淨空與結構厚度必須同時檢核。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: Inputs outerRadius=5.30 m, innerRadius=5.00 m, length=10 m; fullRingVolume=pi*(5.30^2-5.00^2)*10=97.08 m3, idealized full circular ring. The carriage is a temporary structure; final clearance and structural thickness need simultaneous checks. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「拱頂填充與空洞」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Crown filling and voids\", which statement holds?","options":["接縫外表平整就能保證內部止水帶位置正確","原創教學假設：Inputs outerRadius=5.30 m, innerRadius=5.00 m, length=10 m; fullRingVolume=pi*(5.30^2-5.00^2)*10=97.08 m3, idealized full circular ring。","內部淨空越大就表示襯砌品質越好"],"optionsEn":["A flush surface joint guarantees the internal waterstop is correctly located","Original teaching assumptions: Inputs outerRadius=5.30 m, innerRadius=5.00 m, length=10 m.","Greater interior clearance always means better lining quality"],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設：Inputs outerRadius=5.30 m, innerRadius=5.00 m, length=10 m; fullRingVolume=pi*(5.30^2-5.00^2)*10=97.08 m3, idealized full circular ring。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: Inputs outerRadius=5.30 m, innerRadius=5.00 m, length=10 m; fullRingVolume=pi*(5.30^2-5.00^2)*10=97.08 m3, idealized full circular ring. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b158-v14-23","title":"拱頂填充與空洞：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Crown filling and voids: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「拱頂填充與空洞」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Crown filling and voids” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"對照材料收支、拱頂檢測與可取得的孔內或雷達證據。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「拱頂空洞削弱接觸並集中彎曲，外表平順仍可能漏判」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare material balance with crown checks and available borehole or radar evidence. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: A crown void weakens contact and concentrates bending despite a smooth interior. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將對照材料收支、拱頂檢測與可取得的孔內或雷達證據列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現拱頂空洞削弱接觸並集中彎曲，外表平順仍可能漏判，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","observationEn":"Site practice: Apply the following check at handover: Compare material balance with crown checks and available borehole or radar evidence. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If a crown void weakens contact and concentrates bending despite a smooth interior, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","failure":"注意干擾：拱頂空洞削弱接觸並集中彎曲，外表平順仍可能漏判。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A crown void weakens contact and concentrates bending despite a smooth interior. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"對照材料收支、拱頂檢測與可取得的孔內或雷達證據。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「拱頂空洞削弱接觸並集中彎曲，外表平順仍可能漏判」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。","textEn":"Compare material balance with crown checks and available borehole or radar evidence. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: A crown void weakens contact and concentrates bending despite a smooth interior. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將對照材料收支、拱頂檢測與可取得的孔內或雷達證據列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現拱頂空洞削弱接觸並集中彎曲，外表平順仍可能漏判，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","textEn":"Apply the following check at handover: Compare material balance with crown checks and available borehole or radar evidence. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If a crown void weakens contact and concentrates bending despite a smooth interior, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「拱頂填充與空洞」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Crown filling and voids\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","模板厚度一致就能保證每一位置撓度一致","對照材料收支、拱頂檢測與可取得的孔內或雷達證據。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","Uniform form thickness guarantees uniform deflection at every position","Compare material balance with crown checks and available borehole or radar evidence."],"answer":2,"explanation":"對照材料收支、拱頂檢測與可取得的孔內或雷達證據。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare material balance with crown checks and available borehole or radar evidence. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b158-v14-24","title":"拱頂填充與空洞：失效診斷","titleEn":"Crown filling and voids: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「拱頂填充與空洞」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Crown filling and voids” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"拱頂空洞削弱接觸並集中彎曲，外表平順仍可能漏判。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到對照材料收支、拱頂檢測與可取得的孔內或雷達證據，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A crown void weakens contact and concentrates bending despite a smooth interior. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare material balance with crown checks and available borehole or radar evidence to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：判別這個機制時，應觀察對照材料收支、拱頂檢測與可取得的孔內或雷達證據；若出現拱頂空洞削弱接觸並集中彎曲，外表平順仍可能漏判，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: If a crown void weakens contact and concentrates bending despite a smooth interior, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「混凝土總用量達到理論值就證明沒有空洞」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Delivered concrete equal to theoretical volume proves there are no voids\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"拱頂空洞削弱接觸並集中彎曲，外表平順仍可能漏判。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到對照材料收支、拱頂檢測與可取得的孔內或雷達證據，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。","textEn":"A crown void weakens contact and concentrates bending despite a smooth interior. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to compare material balance with crown checks and available borehole or radar evidence to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「拱頂填充與空洞」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Crown filling and voids\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["拱頂空洞削弱接觸並集中彎曲，外表平順仍可能漏判。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","早齡抗壓比值低就能取代所有拆模階段檢核"],"optionsEn":["A crown void weakens contact and concentrates bending despite a smooth interior.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","A low early compression ratio replaces every stripping-stage check"],"answer":0,"explanation":"拱頂空洞削弱接觸並集中彎曲，外表平順仍可能漏判。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A crown void weakens contact and concentrates bending despite a smooth interior. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b158-v14-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「早齡拆模與支承轉換」與「溫度收縮與約束裂縫」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Early stripping and support transfer\" and \"Thermal contraction and restrained cracking\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b158-v14-25","title":"早齡拆模與支承轉換：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Early stripping and support transfer: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-24"],"objective":"說明「早齡拆模與支承轉換」如何影響隧道二次襯砌台車施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Early stripping and support transfer” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Tunnel secondary lining with formwork carriages”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"拆模把混凝土自重及外力轉交給尚在硬化的襯砌，試件強度要能代表現地齡期與溫度。強度之外還有模數、裂縫及接觸條件，單一抗壓值不能證明整環穩定；支承轉換應明確納入施工階段模型。 判別這個機制時，應觀察將原位成熟度、可比試件及拆模後裂縫觀察配對；若出現暖室試件高估現地強度，支承撤除後形成早齡裂紋，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「早齡拆模與支承轉換」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Stripping transfers self-weight and external actions to hardening lining, so specimens must represent in-place age and temperature. Modulus, cracks and contact matter as well as compression strength. One strength value cannot establish ring stability; model the support transition explicitly. Use the following check to discriminate the mechanism: Pair in-place maturity and representative specimens with post-stripping crack observations. If warm specimens overstate field strength and early cracks form after support removal, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Early stripping and support transfer” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：stressRatio=assumedDemand/earlyStrength=1.5 MPa/6 MPa=0.25。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: stressRatio=assumedDemand/earlyStrength=1.5 MPa/6 MPa=0.25.","failure":"常見誤解：「早齡抗壓比值低就能取代所有拆模階段檢核」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A low early compression ratio replaces every stripping-stage check\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「早齡拆模與支承轉換」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Early stripping and support transfer”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-25-k1","title":"早齡拆模與支承轉換","titleEn":"Early stripping and support transfer","text":"拆模把混凝土自重及外力轉交給尚在硬化的襯砌，試件強度要能代表現地齡期與溫度。強度之外還有模數、裂縫及接觸條件，單一抗壓值不能證明整環穩定；支承轉換應明確納入施工階段模型。","textEn":"Stripping transfers self-weight and external actions to hardening lining, so specimens must represent in-place age and temperature. Modulus, cracks and contact matter as well as compression strength.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：早齡抗壓比值低就能取代所有拆模階段檢核 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A low early compression ratio replaces every stripping-stage check Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「早齡拆模與支承轉換」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Early stripping and support transfer\" is correct?","options":["早齡抗壓比值低就能取代所有拆模階段檢核","拆模把混凝土自重及外力轉交給尚在硬化的襯砌，試件強度要能代表現地齡期與溫度。","混凝土不再升溫後就不會發生溫度裂縫"],"optionsEn":["A low early compression ratio replaces every stripping-stage check","Stripping transfers self-weight and external actions to hardening lining, so specimens must represent in-place age and temperature.","Thermal cracking cannot occur once concrete stops heating"],"answer":1,"explanation":"拆模把混凝土自重及外力轉交給尚在硬化的襯砌，試件強度要能代表現地齡期與溫度。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Stripping transfers self-weight and external actions to hardening lining, so specimens must represent in-place age and temperature. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b158-v14-26","title":"早齡拆模與支承轉換：定量估算","titleEn":"Early stripping and support transfer: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「早齡拆模與支承轉換」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Early stripping and support transfer” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：stressRatio=assumedDemand/earlyStrength=1.5 MPa/6 MPa=0.25。台車是施工階段構造，完成面淨空與結構厚度必須同時檢核。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: stressRatio=assumedDemand/earlyStrength=1.5 MPa/6 MPa=0.25. The carriage is a temporary structure; final clearance and structural thickness need simultaneous checks. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：將原位成熟度、可比試件及拆模後裂縫觀察配對。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Pair in-place maturity and representative specimens with post-stripping crack observations.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：stressRatio=assumedDemand/earlyStrength=1.5 MPa/6 MPa=0.25。台車是施工階段構造，完成面淨空與結構厚度必須同時檢核。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: stressRatio=assumedDemand/earlyStrength=1.5 MPa/6 MPa=0.25. The carriage is a temporary structure; final clearance and structural thickness need simultaneous checks. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「早齡拆模與支承轉換」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Early stripping and support transfer\", which statement holds?","options":["台車出廠合格就不需要每循環重新定位檢查","混凝土強度高就代表施工側壓一定比較小","原創教學假設：stressRatio=assumedDemand/earlyStrength=1.5 MPa/6 MPa=0.25。"],"optionsEn":["Factory-approved carriages never need positioning checks during later cycles","High concrete strength guarantees lower pressure during placement","Original teaching assumptions: stressRatio=assumedDemand/earlyStrength=1.5 MPa/6 MPa=0.25."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設：stressRatio=assumedDemand/earlyStrength=1.5 MPa/6 MPa=0.25。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: stressRatio=assumedDemand/earlyStrength=1.5 MPa/6 MPa=0.25. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b158-v14-27","title":"早齡拆模與支承轉換：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Early stripping and support transfer: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「早齡拆模與支承轉換」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Early stripping and support transfer” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"將原位成熟度、可比試件及拆模後裂縫觀察配對。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「暖室試件高估現地強度，支承撤除後形成早齡裂紋」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Pair in-place maturity and representative specimens with post-stripping crack observations. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Warm specimens overstate field strength and early cracks form after support removal. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將將原位成熟度、可比試件及拆模後裂縫觀察配對列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現暖室試件高估現地強度，支承撤除後形成早齡裂紋，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","observationEn":"Site practice: Apply the following check at handover: Pair in-place maturity and representative specimens with post-stripping crack observations. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If warm specimens overstate field strength and early cracks form after support removal, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","failure":"注意干擾：暖室試件高估現地強度，支承撤除後形成早齡裂紋。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Warm specimens overstate field strength and early cracks form after support removal. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"將原位成熟度、可比試件及拆模後裂縫觀察配對。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「暖室試件高估現地強度，支承撤除後形成早齡裂紋」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。","textEn":"Pair in-place maturity and representative specimens with post-stripping crack observations. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Warm specimens overstate field strength and early cracks form after support removal. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將將原位成熟度、可比試件及拆模後裂縫觀察配對列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現暖室試件高估現地強度，支承撤除後形成早齡裂紋，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","textEn":"Apply the following check at handover: Pair in-place maturity and representative specimens with post-stripping crack observations. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If warm specimens overstate field strength and early cracks form after support removal, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「早齡拆模與支承轉換」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Early stripping and support transfer\"?","options":["將原位成熟度、可比試件及拆模後裂縫觀察配對。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、開挖序列與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","總重量除以支腳數就能得到每腳實際反力"],"optionsEn":["Pair in-place maturity and representative specimens with post-stripping crack observations.","Temperature, water head, excavation sequence and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Total weight divided by foot count gives each actual reaction"],"answer":0,"explanation":"將原位成熟度、可比試件及拆模後裂縫觀察配對。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Pair in-place maturity and representative specimens with post-stripping crack observations. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b158-v14-28","title":"早齡拆模與支承轉換：失效診斷","titleEn":"Early stripping and support transfer: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「早齡拆模與支承轉換」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Early stripping and support transfer” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"暖室試件高估現地強度，支承撤除後形成早齡裂紋。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到將原位成熟度、可比試件及拆模後裂縫觀察配對，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Warm specimens overstate field strength and early cracks form after support removal. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to pair in-place maturity and representative specimens with post-stripping crack observations to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：判別這個機制時，應觀察將原位成熟度、可比試件及拆模後裂縫觀察配對；若出現暖室試件高估現地強度，支承撤除後形成早齡裂紋，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: If warm specimens overstate field strength and early cracks form after support removal, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「早齡抗壓比值低就能取代所有拆模階段檢核」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A low early compression ratio replaces every stripping-stage check\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"暖室試件高估現地強度，支承撤除後形成早齡裂紋。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到將原位成熟度、可比試件及拆模後裂縫觀察配對，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。","textEn":"Warm specimens overstate field strength and early cracks form after support removal. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to pair in-place maturity and representative specimens with post-stripping crack observations to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「早齡拆模與支承轉換」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Early stripping and support transfer\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","暖室試件高估現地強度，支承撤除後形成早齡裂紋。","混凝土不再升溫後就不會發生溫度裂縫"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Warm specimens overstate field strength and early cracks form after support removal.","Thermal cracking cannot occur once concrete stops heating"],"answer":1,"explanation":"暖室試件高估現地強度，支承撤除後形成早齡裂紋。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Warm specimens overstate field strength and early cracks form after support removal. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b158-v14-29","title":"溫度收縮與約束裂縫：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Thermal contraction and restrained cracking: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-28"],"objective":"說明「溫度收縮與約束裂縫」如何影響隧道二次襯砌台車施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Thermal contraction and restrained cracking” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Tunnel secondary lining with formwork carriages”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"水化升溫後的降溫使襯砌收縮，初支、底部或相鄰段可能限制其自由變形。完全約束公式只是一個上限模型，徐變與接觸滑移會降低應力；監測需把溫度梯度與整體降溫分開，避免將所有裂縫都歸因於強度不足。 判別這個機制時，應觀察同步量測核心與表面溫度、應變及裂縫出現時刻；若出現只看最高溫度漏掉降溫約束，延後才發現貫通裂縫，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「溫度收縮與約束裂縫」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Cooling after hydration contracts lining against restraint from initial support, the base or adjacent pours. Full restraint is an upper-bound model reduced by creep and slip. Separate thermal gradients from bulk cooling instead of attributing every crack to low strength. Use the following check to discriminate the mechanism: Synchronize core and surface temperatures, strain and crack-onset times. If peak-temperature checks miss cooling restraint and through-cracks are discovered late, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Thermal contraction and restrained cracking” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：freeStrain=alpha*dT=1e-5/K*20 K=0.0002; fullRestraintStress=20 GPa*0.0002=4 MPa。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: freeStrain=alpha*dT=1e-5/K*20 K=0.0002; fullRestraintStress=20 GPa*0.0002=4 MPa.","failure":"常見誤解：「混凝土不再升溫後就不會發生溫度裂縫」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Thermal cracking cannot occur once concrete stops heating\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「溫度收縮與約束裂縫」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Thermal contraction and restrained cracking”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-29-k1","title":"溫度收縮與約束裂縫","titleEn":"Thermal contraction and restrained cracking","text":"水化升溫後的降溫使襯砌收縮，初支、底部或相鄰段可能限制其自由變形。完全約束公式只是一個上限模型，徐變與接觸滑移會降低應力；監測需把溫度梯度與整體降溫分開，避免將所有裂縫都歸因於強度不足。","textEn":"Cooling after hydration contracts lining against restraint from initial support, the base or adjacent pours. Full restraint is an upper-bound model reduced by creep and slip.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：混凝土不再升溫後就不會發生溫度裂縫 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Thermal cracking cannot occur once concrete stops heating Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「溫度收縮與約束裂縫」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Thermal contraction and restrained cracking\" is correct?","options":["混凝土不再升溫後就不會發生溫度裂縫","接縫外表平整就能保證內部止水帶位置正確","水化升溫後的降溫使襯砌收縮，初支、底部或相鄰段可能限制其自由變形。"],"optionsEn":["Thermal cracking cannot occur once concrete stops heating","A flush surface joint guarantees the internal waterstop is correctly located","Cooling after hydration contracts lining against restraint from initial support, the base or adjacent pours."],"answer":2,"explanation":"水化升溫後的降溫使襯砌收縮，初支、底部或相鄰段可能限制其自由變形。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Cooling after hydration contracts lining against restraint from initial support, the base or adjacent pours. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b158-v14-30","title":"溫度收縮與約束裂縫：定量估算","titleEn":"Thermal contraction and restrained cracking: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「溫度收縮與約束裂縫」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Thermal contraction and restrained cracking” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：freeStrain=alpha*dT=1e-5/K*20 K=0.0002; fullRestraintStress=20 GPa*0.0002=4 MPa。台車是施工階段構造，完成面淨空與結構厚度必須同時檢核。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: freeStrain=alpha*dT=1e-5/K*20 K=0.0002; fullRestraintStress=20 GPa*0.0002=4 MPa. The carriage is a temporary structure; final clearance and structural thickness need simultaneous checks. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：同步量測核心與表面溫度、應變及裂縫出現時刻。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Synchronize core and surface temperatures, strain and crack-onset times.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：freeStrain=alpha*dT=1e-5/K*20 K=0.0002; fullRestraintStress=20 GPa*0.0002=4 MPa。台車是施工階段構造，完成面淨空與結構厚度必須同時檢核。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: freeStrain=alpha*dT=1e-5/K*20 K=0.0002; fullRestraintStress=20 GPa*0.0002=4 MPa. The carriage is a temporary structure; final clearance and structural thickness need simultaneous checks. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「溫度收縮與約束裂縫」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Thermal contraction and restrained cracking\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設：freeStrain=alpha*dT=1e-5/K*20 K=0.0002; fullRestraintStress=20 GPa*0.0002=4 MPa。","內部淨空越大就表示襯砌品質越好","模板厚度一致就能保證每一位置撓度一致"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching assumptions: freeStrain=alpha*dT=1e-5/K*20 K=0.0002; fullRestraintStress=20 GPa*0.0002=4 MPa.","Greater interior clearance always means better lining quality","Uniform form thickness guarantees uniform deflection at every position"],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設：freeStrain=alpha*dT=1e-5/K*20 K=0.0002; fullRestraintStress=20 GPa*0.0002=4 MPa。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: freeStrain=alpha*dT=1e-5/K*20 K=0.0002; fullRestraintStress=20 GPa*0.0002=4 MPa. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b158-v14-31","title":"溫度收縮與約束裂縫：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Thermal contraction and restrained cracking: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「溫度收縮與約束裂縫」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Thermal contraction and restrained cracking” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"同步量測核心與表面溫度、應變及裂縫出現時刻。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「只看最高溫度漏掉降溫約束，延後才發現貫通裂縫」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Synchronize core and surface temperatures, strain and crack-onset times. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Peak-temperature checks miss cooling restraint and through-cracks are discovered late. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將同步量測核心與表面溫度、應變及裂縫出現時刻列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現只看最高溫度漏掉降溫約束，延後才發現貫通裂縫，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","observationEn":"Site practice: Apply the following check at handover: Synchronize core and surface temperatures, strain and crack-onset times. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If peak-temperature checks miss cooling restraint and through-cracks are discovered late, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","failure":"注意干擾：只看最高溫度漏掉降溫約束，延後才發現貫通裂縫。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Peak-temperature checks miss cooling restraint and through-cracks are discovered late. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"同步量測核心與表面溫度、應變及裂縫出現時刻。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「只看最高溫度漏掉降溫約束，延後才發現貫通裂縫」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。","textEn":"Synchronize core and surface temperatures, strain and crack-onset times. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Peak-temperature checks miss cooling restraint and through-cracks are discovered late. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將同步量測核心與表面溫度、應變及裂縫出現時刻列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現只看最高溫度漏掉降溫約束，延後才發現貫通裂縫，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","textEn":"Apply the following check at handover: Synchronize core and surface temperatures, strain and crack-onset times. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If peak-temperature checks miss cooling restraint and through-cracks are discovered late, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「溫度收縮與約束裂縫」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Thermal contraction and restrained cracking\"?","options":["沿用另一條隧道或另一處地層的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","同步量測核心與表面溫度、應變及裂縫出現時刻。","台車很重就不可能受到混凝土壓力抬升"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another tunnel or ground formation counts as verifying this structure.","Synchronize core and surface temperatures, strain and crack-onset times.","A heavy carriage cannot be lifted by concrete pressure"],"answer":1,"explanation":"同步量測核心與表面溫度、應變及裂縫出現時刻。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Synchronize core and surface temperatures, strain and crack-onset times. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b158-v14-32","title":"溫度收縮與約束裂縫：失效診斷","titleEn":"Thermal contraction and restrained cracking: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「溫度收縮與約束裂縫」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Thermal contraction and restrained cracking” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"只看最高溫度漏掉降溫約束，延後才發現貫通裂縫。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到同步量測核心與表面溫度、應變及裂縫出現時刻，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Peak-temperature checks miss cooling restraint and through-cracks are discovered late. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to synchronize core and surface temperatures, strain and crack-onset times to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：判別這個機制時，應觀察同步量測核心與表面溫度、應變及裂縫出現時刻；若出現只看最高溫度漏掉降溫約束，延後才發現貫通裂縫，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: If peak-temperature checks miss cooling restraint and through-cracks are discovered late, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「混凝土不再升溫後就不會發生溫度裂縫」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Thermal cracking cannot occur once concrete stops heating\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只看最高溫度漏掉降溫約束，延後才發現貫通裂縫。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到同步量測核心與表面溫度、應變及裂縫出現時刻，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。","textEn":"Peak-temperature checks miss cooling restraint and through-cracks are discovered late. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to synchronize core and surface temperatures, strain and crack-onset times to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「溫度收縮與約束裂縫」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Thermal contraction and restrained cracking\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","接縫外表平整就能保證內部止水帶位置正確","只看最高溫度漏掉降溫約束，延後才發現貫通裂縫。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","A flush surface joint guarantees the internal waterstop is correctly located","Peak-temperature checks miss cooling restraint and through-cracks are discovered late."],"answer":2,"explanation":"只看最高溫度漏掉降溫約束，延後才發現貫通裂縫。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Peak-temperature checks miss cooling restraint and through-cracks are discovered late. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b158-v14-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「施工縫對接與止水連續」與「台車循環與品質追溯」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Construction joints and waterstop continuity\" and \"Carriage cycles and quality traceability\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b158-v14-33","title":"施工縫對接與止水連續：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Construction joints and waterstop continuity: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-32"],"objective":"說明「施工縫對接與止水連續」如何影響隧道二次襯砌台車施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Construction joints and waterstop continuity” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Tunnel secondary lining with formwork carriages”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"台車循環形成分段施工縫，接縫需要在幾何、剪力與止水三方面連續。止水帶偏位可能在澆置後被完全遮蔽，外表縫線整齊也無法證明埋入長度；前後兩段資料應共同索引到同一接縫編號。 判別這個機制時，應觀察檢查止水帶位置、固定狀態及兩段施工前後影像；若出現止水帶偏折形成漏水捷徑，表面接縫看不出缺陷，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「施工縫對接與止水連續」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Carriage cycles create joints requiring geometric, shear and hydraulic continuity. A displaced waterstop becomes concealed after casting, and a neat visible line does not establish embedment. Index records from both adjacent pours to the same joint identifier. Use the following check to discriminate the mechanism: Check waterstop position, restraint and images before and after both pours. If a folded waterstop creates a leakage shortcut invisible at the surface joint, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Construction joints and waterstop continuity” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：embedmentImbalance=left-right=110 mm-70 mm=40 mm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: embedmentImbalance=left-right=110 mm-70 mm=40 mm.","failure":"常見誤解：「接縫外表平整就能保證內部止水帶位置正確」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A flush surface joint guarantees the internal waterstop is correctly located\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「施工縫對接與止水連續」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Construction joints and waterstop continuity”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-33-k1","title":"施工縫對接與止水連續","titleEn":"Construction joints and waterstop continuity","text":"台車循環形成分段施工縫，接縫需要在幾何、剪力與止水三方面連續。止水帶偏位可能在澆置後被完全遮蔽，外表縫線整齊也無法證明埋入長度；前後兩段資料應共同索引到同一接縫編號。","textEn":"Carriage cycles create joints requiring geometric, shear and hydraulic continuity. A displaced waterstop becomes concealed after casting, and a neat visible line does not establish embedment.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：接縫外表平整就能保證內部止水帶位置正確 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A flush surface joint guarantees the internal waterstop is correctly located Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「施工縫對接與止水連續」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Construction joints and waterstop continuity\" is correct?","options":["台車循環形成分段施工縫，接縫需要在幾何、剪力與止水三方面連續。","接縫外表平整就能保證內部止水帶位置正確","台車出廠合格就不需要每循環重新定位檢查"],"optionsEn":["Carriage cycles create joints requiring geometric, shear and hydraulic continuity.","A flush surface joint guarantees the internal waterstop is correctly located","Factory-approved carriages never need positioning checks during later cycles"],"answer":0,"explanation":"台車循環形成分段施工縫，接縫需要在幾何、剪力與止水三方面連續。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Carriage cycles create joints requiring geometric, shear and hydraulic continuity. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b158-v14-34","title":"施工縫對接與止水連續：定量估算","titleEn":"Construction joints and waterstop continuity: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「施工縫對接與止水連續」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Construction joints and waterstop continuity” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：embedmentImbalance=left-right=110 mm-70 mm=40 mm。台車是施工階段構造，完成面淨空與結構厚度必須同時檢核。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: embedmentImbalance=left-right=110 mm-70 mm=40 mm. The carriage is a temporary structure; final clearance and structural thickness need simultaneous checks. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：檢查止水帶位置、固定狀態及兩段施工前後影像。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check waterstop position, restraint and images before and after both pours.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：embedmentImbalance=left-right=110 mm-70 mm=40 mm。台車是施工階段構造，完成面淨空與結構厚度必須同時檢核。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: embedmentImbalance=left-right=110 mm-70 mm=40 mm. The carriage is a temporary structure; final clearance and structural thickness need simultaneous checks. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「施工縫對接與止水連續」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Construction joints and waterstop continuity\", which statement holds?","options":["混凝土強度高就代表施工側壓一定比較小","原創教學假設：embedmentImbalance=left-right=110 mm-70 mm=40 mm。","總重量除以支腳數就能得到每腳實際反力"],"optionsEn":["High concrete strength guarantees lower pressure during placement","Original teaching assumptions: embedmentImbalance=left-right=110 mm-70 mm=40 mm.","Total weight divided by foot count gives each actual reaction"],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設：embedmentImbalance=left-right=110 mm-70 mm=40 mm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: embedmentImbalance=left-right=110 mm-70 mm=40 mm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b158-v14-35","title":"施工縫對接與止水連續：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Construction joints and waterstop continuity: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「施工縫對接與止水連續」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Construction joints and waterstop continuity” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"檢查止水帶位置、固定狀態及兩段施工前後影像。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「止水帶偏折形成漏水捷徑，表面接縫看不出缺陷」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check waterstop position, restraint and images before and after both pours. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: A folded waterstop creates a leakage shortcut invisible at the surface joint. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將檢查止水帶位置、固定狀態及兩段施工前後影像列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現止水帶偏折形成漏水捷徑，表面接縫看不出缺陷，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","observationEn":"Site practice: Apply the following check at handover: Check waterstop position, restraint and images before and after both pours. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If a folded waterstop creates a leakage shortcut invisible at the surface joint, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","failure":"注意干擾：止水帶偏折形成漏水捷徑，表面接縫看不出缺陷。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A folded waterstop creates a leakage shortcut invisible at the surface joint. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"檢查止水帶位置、固定狀態及兩段施工前後影像。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「止水帶偏折形成漏水捷徑，表面接縫看不出缺陷」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。","textEn":"Check waterstop position, restraint and images before and after both pours. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: A folded waterstop creates a leakage shortcut invisible at the surface joint. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將檢查止水帶位置、固定狀態及兩段施工前後影像列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現止水帶偏折形成漏水捷徑，表面接縫看不出缺陷，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","textEn":"Apply the following check at handover: Check waterstop position, restraint and images before and after both pours. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If a folded waterstop creates a leakage shortcut invisible at the surface joint, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「施工縫對接與止水連續」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Construction joints and waterstop continuity\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","混凝土總用量達到理論值就證明沒有空洞","檢查止水帶位置、固定狀態及兩段施工前後影像。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Delivered concrete equal to theoretical volume proves there are no voids","Check waterstop position, restraint and images before and after both pours."],"answer":2,"explanation":"檢查止水帶位置、固定狀態及兩段施工前後影像。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check waterstop position, restraint and images before and after both pours. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b158-v14-36","title":"施工縫對接與止水連續：失效診斷","titleEn":"Construction joints and waterstop continuity: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「施工縫對接與止水連續」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Construction joints and waterstop continuity” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"止水帶偏折形成漏水捷徑，表面接縫看不出缺陷。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到檢查止水帶位置、固定狀態及兩段施工前後影像，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A folded waterstop creates a leakage shortcut invisible at the surface joint. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to check waterstop position, restraint and images before and after both pours to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：判別這個機制時，應觀察檢查止水帶位置、固定狀態及兩段施工前後影像；若出現止水帶偏折形成漏水捷徑，表面接縫看不出缺陷，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: If a folded waterstop creates a leakage shortcut invisible at the surface joint, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「接縫外表平整就能保證內部止水帶位置正確」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A flush surface joint guarantees the internal waterstop is correctly located\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"止水帶偏折形成漏水捷徑，表面接縫看不出缺陷。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到檢查止水帶位置、固定狀態及兩段施工前後影像，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。","textEn":"A folded waterstop creates a leakage shortcut invisible at the surface joint. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to check waterstop position, restraint and images before and after both pours to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「施工縫對接與止水連續」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Construction joints and waterstop continuity\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["止水帶偏折形成漏水捷徑，表面接縫看不出缺陷。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","台車出廠合格就不需要每循環重新定位檢查"],"optionsEn":["A folded waterstop creates a leakage shortcut invisible at the surface joint.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Factory-approved carriages never need positioning checks during later cycles"],"answer":0,"explanation":"止水帶偏折形成漏水捷徑，表面接縫看不出缺陷。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A folded waterstop creates a leakage shortcut invisible at the surface joint. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b158-v14-37","title":"台車循環與品質追溯：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Carriage cycles and quality traceability: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-36"],"objective":"說明「台車循環與品質追溯」如何影響隧道二次襯砌台車施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Carriage cycles and quality traceability” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Tunnel secondary lining with formwork carriages”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"同一台車會重複移動、調整和受載，螺接鬆動或幾何漂移可能逐循環累積。出廠合格只描述初始設備，不代表每次定位正確；交接須把台車版本、定位檢查與各襯砌段的材料和缺陷關聯，讓系統性偏差可被辨認。 判別這個機制時，應觀察用每循環定位殘差與設備檢查紀錄分析累積偏差；若出現持續小偏位在多循環後侵入淨空，單次目視卻未察覺，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「台車循環與品質追溯」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Repeated moves, adjustments and loads accumulate loosened connections and geometric drift. Factory acceptance describes initial equipment rather than each setup. Link carriage revisions and positioning checks to lining batches and defects so systematic errors can be recognized across cycles. Use the following check to discriminate the mechanism: Analyze accumulated setup residuals alongside equipment inspection records. If small repeated offsets eventually encroach on clearance while individual visual checks miss them, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Carriage cycles and quality traceability” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：driftPerCycle=totalDrift/cycles=12 mm/6=2 mm per cycle。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: driftPerCycle=totalDrift/cycles=12 mm/6=2 mm per cycle.","failure":"常見誤解：「台車出廠合格就不需要每循環重新定位檢查」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Factory-approved carriages never need positioning checks during later cycles\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「台車循環與品質追溯」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Carriage cycles and quality traceability”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-37-k1","title":"台車循環與品質追溯","titleEn":"Carriage cycles and quality traceability","text":"同一台車會重複移動、調整和受載，螺接鬆動或幾何漂移可能逐循環累積。出廠合格只描述初始設備，不代表每次定位正確；交接須把台車版本、定位檢查與各襯砌段的材料和缺陷關聯，讓系統性偏差可被辨認。","textEn":"Repeated moves, adjustments and loads accumulate loosened connections and geometric drift. Factory acceptance describes initial equipment rather than each setup.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：台車出廠合格就不需要每循環重新定位檢查 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Factory-approved carriages never need positioning checks during later cycles Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「台車循環與品質追溯」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Carriage cycles and quality traceability\" is correct?","options":["台車出廠合格就不需要每循環重新定位檢查","同一台車會重複移動、調整和受載，螺接鬆動或幾何漂移可能逐循環累積。","內部淨空越大就表示襯砌品質越好"],"optionsEn":["Factory-approved carriages never need positioning checks during later cycles","Repeated moves, adjustments and loads accumulate loosened connections and geometric drift.","Greater interior clearance always means better lining quality"],"answer":1,"explanation":"同一台車會重複移動、調整和受載，螺接鬆動或幾何漂移可能逐循環累積。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Repeated moves, adjustments and loads accumulate loosened connections and geometric drift. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b158-v14-38","title":"台車循環與品質追溯：定量估算","titleEn":"Carriage cycles and quality traceability: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「台車循環與品質追溯」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Carriage cycles and quality traceability” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：driftPerCycle=totalDrift/cycles=12 mm/6=2 mm per cycle。台車是施工階段構造，完成面淨空與結構厚度必須同時檢核。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: driftPerCycle=totalDrift/cycles=12 mm/6=2 mm per cycle. The carriage is a temporary structure; final clearance and structural thickness need simultaneous checks. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：用每循環定位殘差與設備檢查紀錄分析累積偏差。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Analyze accumulated setup residuals alongside equipment inspection records.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：driftPerCycle=totalDrift/cycles=12 mm/6=2 mm per cycle。台車是施工階段構造，完成面淨空與結構厚度必須同時檢核。 此結果僅用來核對量綱及模型敏感度，不是專案設計值、實測紀錄或現場允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: driftPerCycle=totalDrift/cycles=12 mm/6=2 mm per cycle. The carriage is a temporary structure; final clearance and structural thickness need simultaneous checks. This checks dimensions and model sensitivity; it is neither measured project data nor a design or acceptance value.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「台車循環與品質追溯」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Carriage cycles and quality traceability\", which statement holds?","options":["模板厚度一致就能保證每一位置撓度一致","台車很重就不可能受到混凝土壓力抬升","原創教學假設：driftPerCycle=totalDrift/cycles=12 mm/6=2 mm per cycle。"],"optionsEn":["Uniform form thickness guarantees uniform deflection at every position","A heavy carriage cannot be lifted by concrete pressure","Original teaching assumptions: driftPerCycle=totalDrift/cycles=12 mm/6=2 mm per cycle."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設：driftPerCycle=totalDrift/cycles=12 mm/6=2 mm per cycle。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: driftPerCycle=totalDrift/cycles=12 mm/6=2 mm per cycle. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b158-v14-39","title":"台車循環與品質追溯：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Carriage cycles and quality traceability: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「台車循環與品質追溯」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Carriage cycles and quality traceability” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"用每循環定位殘差與設備檢查紀錄分析累積偏差。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「持續小偏位在多循環後侵入淨空，單次目視卻未察覺」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Analyze accumulated setup residuals alongside equipment inspection records. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Small repeated offsets eventually encroach on clearance while individual visual checks miss them. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將用每循環定位殘差與設備檢查紀錄分析累積偏差列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現持續小偏位在多循環後侵入淨空，單次目視卻未察覺，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","observationEn":"Site practice: Apply the following check at handover: Analyze accumulated setup residuals alongside equipment inspection records. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If small repeated offsets eventually encroach on clearance while individual visual checks miss them, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","failure":"注意干擾：持續小偏位在多循環後侵入淨空，單次目視卻未察覺。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Small repeated offsets eventually encroach on clearance while individual visual checks miss them. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用每循環定位殘差與設備檢查紀錄分析累積偏差。量測須保存位置、時間及基準，讓同條件的重複結果可比較；並特別檢查「持續小偏位在多循環後侵入淨空，單次目視卻未察覺」是否能由這組資料區分。儀器校核與誤差估計應先於判讀，由負責技師核定該項試驗的允收和停留點。","textEn":"Analyze accumulated setup residuals alongside equipment inspection records. Retain position, time and datums for comparable repeats, specifically distinguishing this scenario: Small repeated offsets eventually encroach on clearance while individual visual checks miss them. Instrument checks and uncertainty estimates precede interpretation; the responsible engineer sets acceptance and hold points for this test.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將用每循環定位殘差與設備檢查紀錄分析累積偏差列為該構件的交接證據，連結到施工位置、材料批次及判讀版本。若發現持續小偏位在多循環後侵入淨空，單次目視卻未察覺，先保留原始紀錄並由負責技師確認處置，不能以本課算例替代核定作業計畫。","textEn":"Apply the following check at handover: Analyze accumulated setup residuals alongside equipment inspection records. Link results to location, material batch and interpretation version. If small repeated offsets eventually encroach on clearance while individual visual checks miss them, retain original records and obtain the responsible engineer's disposition; this example does not replace an approved work plan.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「台車循環與品質追溯」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Carriage cycles and quality traceability\"?","options":["用每循環定位殘差與設備檢查紀錄分析累積偏差。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","早齡抗壓比值低就能取代所有拆模階段檢核"],"optionsEn":["Analyze accumulated setup residuals alongside equipment inspection records.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","A low early compression ratio replaces every stripping-stage check"],"answer":0,"explanation":"用每循環定位殘差與設備檢查紀錄分析累積偏差。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Analyze accumulated setup residuals alongside equipment inspection records. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b158-v14-40","title":"台車循環與品質追溯：失效診斷","titleEn":"Carriage cycles and quality traceability: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"prerequisiteIds":["b158-v14-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「台車循環與品質追溯」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Carriage cycles and quality traceability” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"持續小偏位在多循環後侵入淨空，單次目視卻未察覺。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到用每循環定位殘差與設備檢查紀錄分析累積偏差，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Small repeated offsets eventually encroach on clearance while individual visual checks miss them. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to analyze accumulated setup residuals alongside equipment inspection records to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：判別這個機制時，應觀察用每循環定位殘差與設備檢查紀錄分析累積偏差；若出現持續小偏位在多循環後侵入淨空，單次目視卻未察覺，便須重新檢查原先假設的接觸、力或水的傳遞邊界，而不能只調整計算結果。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: If small repeated offsets eventually encroach on clearance while individual visual checks miss them, revisit the assumed contact, force or water-transfer boundary rather than merely adjusting the calculated result.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「台車出廠合格就不需要每循環重新定位檢查」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Factory-approved carriages never need positioning checks during later cycles\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b158-v14-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"持續小偏位在多循環後侵入淨空，單次目視卻未察覺。相似表徵也可能由量測偏差造成，因此應回到用每循環定位殘差與設備檢查紀錄分析累積偏差，以獨立證據判別原因；只修補可見症狀將留下原本的傳力或滲流問題。","textEn":"Small repeated offsets eventually encroach on clearance while individual visual checks miss them. Similar symptoms can arise from measurement bias: return to analyze accumulated setup residuals alongside equipment inspection records to discriminate the cause. Treating visible symptoms alone leaves the original transfer or seepage problem unresolved.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]},{"id":"b158-v14-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「台車循環與品質追溯」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Carriage cycles and quality traceability\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","持續小偏位在多循環後侵入淨空，單次目視卻未察覺。","內部淨空越大就表示襯砌品質越好"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Small repeated offsets eventually encroach on clearance while individual visual checks miss them.","Greater interior clearance always means better lining quality"],"answer":1,"explanation":"持續小偏位在多循環後侵入淨空，單次目視卻未察覺。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Small repeated offsets eventually encroach on clearance while individual visual checks miss them. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["b-src-underground","v14s-cedd-g4","v14s-fhwa-tomie","v14s-sika-tunnel"],"curriculumVersion":14,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
